# webcrack
[Permalink: webcrack](https://github.com/j4k0xb/webcrack#webcrack)

webcrack is a tool for reverse engineering javascript. It can deobfuscate [obfuscator.io](https://github.com/javascript-obfuscator/javascript-obfuscator), unminify,

## API
```
import fs from 'fs';
import { webcrack } from 'webcrack';

const input = fs.readFileSync('bundle.js', 'utf8');

const result = await webcrack(input);
console.log(result.code);
console.log(result.bundle);
await result.save('output-dir');
```

## About
Deobfuscate obfuscator.io, unminify and unpack bundled javascript

